      "titleHtml": null,
      "contentHtml": "<p></p> <audio controls preload=\"none\"> <source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/011111111102.mp3\" type=\"Audio/mpeg\"> </audio> </p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">１．</span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai11_rb_1.mp3\" type=\"Audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"3567621\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>りんごを いくつ <ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いましたか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Anh/chị đã mua bao nhiêu quả táo?</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… 4つ <ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いました</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Tôi đã mua 4 quả.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2．</span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai11_rb_2.mp3\" type=\"Audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"3567622\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>80<ruby>円<rp>(</rp><rt>えん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>切手<rp>(</rp><rt>きって</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を 5<ruby>枚<rp>(</rp><rt>まい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と はがきを 2<ruby>枚<rp>(</rp><rt>まい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> ください。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Hãy cho tôi 5 con tem 80 yên và hai bưu thiếp.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… はい。<ruby>全部<rp>(</rp><rt>ぜんぶ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で 500<ruby>円<rp>(</rp><rt>えん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">.…Vâng, tổng cộng là 500 yên.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">3．</span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai11_rb_3.mp3\" type=\"Audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"3567623\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>富士大学<rp>(</rp><rt>ふじだいがく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>外国人<rp>(</rp><rt>がいこくじん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>先生<rp>(</rp><rt>せんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が いますか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Có giáo viên nước ngoài ở Trường Đại học Fuji không?</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… はい、3<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> います。みんな <ruby>アメリカ<rp>(</rp><rt>あめりか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>じん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Có, có 3 người. Đều là người Mỹ.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">4．</span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai11_rb_4.mp3\" type=\"Audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"3567624\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>兄弟<rp>(</rp><rt>きょうだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は <ruby>何人<rp>(</rp><rt>なんにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Gia đình anh/chị có mấy người?</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… 4<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>にん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。 <ruby>姉<rp>(</rp><rt>あね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>2人<rp>(</rp><rt>ふたり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>と <ruby>兄<rp>(</rp><rt>あに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>1人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひとり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> います。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…4 người. Có 2 chị gái và 1 anh trai</span>.</div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">5．</span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai11_rb_5.mp3\" type=\"Audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"3567625\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>1<ruby>週間<rp>(</rp><rt>しゅうかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に <ruby>何回<rp>(</rp><rt>なんかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> テニスを しますか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Anh/chị chơi tenis 1 tuần mấy lần?</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… 2<ruby>回<rp>(</rp><rt>かい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ぐらい します。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Chơi khoảng 2 lần.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">6．</span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai11_rb_6.mp3\" type=\"Audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"3567626\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>田中<rp>(</rp><rt>たなか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さんは どのくらい <ruby>スペイン<rp>(</rp><rt>すぺいん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>語<rp>(</rp><rt>ご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を <ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しましたか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Tanaka đã học tiếng Tây Ban Nha được khoảng bao lâu rồi vậy?</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… ３</span>か<ruby>月<rp>(</rp><rt>げつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>勉強<rp>(</rp><rt>べんきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しました。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…Đã học được 3 tháng.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>３か<ruby>月<rp>(</rp><rt>げつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だけですか。<ruby>上手<rp>(</rp><rt>じょうず</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ですね。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">… Chỉ có 3 tháng thôi hả? Giỏi thật đấy.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> <span style=\"font-size:16px;\">7．</span>  </p><div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai11_rb_7.mp3\" type=\"Audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\" __idm_id__=\"3567627\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>大阪<rp>(</rp><rt>おおさか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>から <ruby>東京<rp>(</rp><rt>とうきょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まで <ruby>新幹線<rp>(</rp><rt>しんかんせん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で どのくらい かかりますか。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Từ Osaka đến Tokyo đi bằng Shinkanshen mất bao lâu?</div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p><div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>… 2<ruby>時間<rp>(</rp><rt>じかん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>半<rp>(</rp><rt>はん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> かかります。</span></div><div class=\"kqdich\" style=\"opacity: 0; display: none;\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">…mất 2 tiếng rưỡi.</span></div></div></div><p></p> <p> </p></div>",
